{"slug":"floyd-mayweather-thanks-luka-doncic-for-his-signed-mavs-jersey","postId":73405,"title":"Floyd Mayweather Thanks Luka Doncic For His Signed Mavs Jersey","htmlContent":"&nbsp;\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_502595\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"750\"]<img class=\"size-full wp-image-502595\" src=\"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/5c7511bd2628980ad2492002-750-563.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"563\"> Associated Press[/caption]\n\nOn February 26th, Dallas Mavericks were in town to face the Los Angeles Clippers for the fourth and final time this season. Mavericks rookie Luka Doncic had the opportunity to meet with Floyd \"Money\" Mayweather before the game. Mayweather likes many other celebrities such as the Saints Dez Bryant, Cowboys Ezekiel Elliott to name a few all have come out to see Doncic play in person around the league.\n\nAfter the 121-112 loss to the Clippers, Doncic told <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/article/us-basketball-nba-dal-feature-idUSKCN1QF2NV\">Reuters scribe Jahmal Corner</a> about his interaction with Mayweather.\n\n“He said he plays like me,” Doncic told Reuters of his interaction with Mayweather on Monday. “I said, ‘cool, I want to see it live.’”\n\n&nbsp;\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/BucKwZJhGQT/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_medium=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"12\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding: 0 4px;\"><a style=\"color: #000; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none; word-wrap: break-word;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/BucKwZJhGQT/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_medium=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Future legend! Thanks for the jersey Luka Doncic !</a></p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">A post shared by <a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/floydmayweather/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_medium=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Floyd Mayweather</a> (@floydmayweather) on <time style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\" datetime=\"2019-02-28T21:13:06+00:00\">Feb 28, 2019 at 1:13pm PST</time></p>\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<script async=\"\" src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script>\nMayweather participates in numerous celebrity basketball games during the off-season, maybe the two could set something up this summer. Until then the Dallas Mavericks are trying to make a playoff push with 18 games remaining in the regular season. They are currently in the 13th spot in the Western Conference and are nine games out of the final playoff spot.\n\nDoncic is currently averaging 20.9 points, 7.2 rebounds, 5.5 assists per game, and is the only player to record four triple-doubles before turning 20 years old in NBA history.\n\n&nbsp;","excerpt":"[caption id=\"attachment_502595\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"750\"] Associated Press[/caption] On February 26th, Dallas Mavericks were in town to face the Los Angeles Clippers for the fourth and final…","publishedAt":"2019-02-28T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2019-02-28T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"dallas","name":"Dallas"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"floyd-money-mayweather","name":"Floyd \"Money\" Mayweather"},{"slug":"jahmal-corner","name":"Jahmal Corner"},{"slug":"la-clippers","name":"LA Clippers"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"luka-doncic","name":"Luka Dončić"},{"slug":"mavs","name":"Mavs"},{"slug":"mavs-nation","name":"Mavs Nation"},{"slug":"mffl","name":"MFFL"},{"slug":"money-team","name":"Money Team"},{"slug":"reuters","name":"Reuters"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/5c7511bd2628980ad2492002-750-563.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/5c7511bd2628980ad2492002-750-563.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/floyd-mayweather-thanks-luka-doncic-for-his-signed-mavs-jersey/"}